@startuml tracker-server-auth-onboarding
title tracker-server — Google login and onboarding

actor User
participant UI as "tracker-ui"
participant API as "tracker-server"
participant Google
database DB as "PostgreSQL"

User -> UI : Open site / Continue with Google
UI -> API : GET /oauth2/authorization/google
API -> Google : OAuth login
Google -> API : callback
API -> DB : find/create app_user by google_sub/email
API -> UI : redirect /auth/callback
UI -> API : GET /api/me
alt onboarded = false
  UI -> User : Onboarding form
  User -> UI : company, first, last name
  UI -> API : POST /api/onboarding
  API -> DB : create organization\nset user OWNER + agent_key
  UI -> User : /org
else onboarded = true
  UI -> User : /org
end

@enduml
